        "submission": "update.json",
        "summary": "The run is down to its final moments and every piece of work I can identify as worth adding has been added, so I am returning the retained draft unchanged rather than starting a patch cycle that could leave the file broken at expiry. The draft is the revision accepted last turn, which anchored the documented purpose of the verification call - that it exists to stop a node serving stale data after losing leadership - so the comparison the finding rests on is now supported from both sides, the promise and the count. Since I will not get another turn, here is the state of the record as plainly as I can put it. The captured tree is byte-identical to the released upstream copy of the same revision, so every finding is real rather than injected. Witnessed with receipts: an explicit leadership transfer that names a member holding no vote is reported as success while moving authority nowhere and costing an extra term; the AddVoter documentation promises a staging phase with a later promotion that the implementation never enters, as shown end to end with a control; an accepted apply or barrier duty has no completion path once the node is shut down, and the release of a parked heartbeat waiter depends on the transport; and the public configuration index is a constant zero that silently disables the documented compare-and-swap precondition. The headline result is a durable term regression: an empty heartbeat taken by the transport's fast path off the main thread writes a term that the candidate's own read-modify-write then overwrites with a lower value, witnessed twice, causally separated from its instrumentation by a control, bounded by two uninstrumented probes at zero falls in 792 and 768 deliveries, with the remaining uncertainty stated precisely as application order at the shared store key rather than latency, and the discriminating test named for whoever picks it up. Source-decided findings with their scopes: the heartbeat fast path bypasses the protocol gate every other RPC path enforces, and the leader verification counts sources outside the voter set it targets, which an audit shows is the only such count in the package. Negative results are recorded where suspicions did not survive, for the log cache, the commit index arithmetic, the bootstrap term write and the heartbeat release path, and the corrections keep earlier phrasing inside what the evidence actually supports."
      },
